WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Welcome to Fruit Blender!

00:02.500 --> 00:05.000
Look at the numbers at the top.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.500
Drag fruits into the blender, or tap them.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.000
Taking away? Drag fruits out of the blender.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.500
Press Blend!

00:12.500 --> 00:15.000
Count the fruits and pick the right number.
